imes  absolutely gold uh a lot of the  the things that they just made up have  gone into the movie  um so in a way it's almost like  the most sort of purified way of  directing an actor because you don't  have to worry about costume you don't  have to worry about makeup you don't  have to worry about lighting you don't  have to worry about if the camera's in  the right place  you know you don't have to worry about  anything other than their performance  and in that sense  it was a complete joy working with all  of them and they were all so different  so brilliant brought completely  different things into the room um  so but it was great it was it was new  but a lot of fun  congratulations again and thank you so  much for your time today  thank you so much thank you
 

